ove back over and made her get it out herself."], [46.16, 48.98, "She held it up to the light and she genuinely screamed."], [49.36, 51.64, "That came out of a bed belonging to someone"], [51.64, 54.18, "who was completely certain it was clean."], [54.44, 58.6, "In lab testing, these captured up to 99% of dust mites"], [58.6, 61.42, "and over 30,000 homes have run them now."], [61.68, 64.98, "But honestly, don't believe me, that isn't what I'm asking."], [65.3, 67.96, "Slide one under your own and see what comes out"], [67.96, 69.88, "of that clean mattress for yourself."], [70.18, 75.24, "Black Friday, save up to 79% with up to 12 free cards"], [75.24, 77.34, "with a 90-day money-back guarantee."]]}